(7480554, 1189722, 98565, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been to White Sands myself but my husband has when he was a young man, so I know pictures of this beautiful site. Usually I like bw pictures, but it doesn''t do any favour for this scene: to show that the sand is actually white instead of a light beige there needed to be some colour in the picture as a contrast (the sky f.e.)</td>', 'I''ve never been to White Sands myself but my husband has when he was a young man, so I know pictures of this beautiful site. Usually I like bw pictures, but it doesn''t do any favour for this scene: to show that the sand is actually white instead of a light beige there needed to be some colour in the picture as a contrast (the sky f.e.)', '2016-11-02 18:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
