(7480660, 1189860, 140305, '<td valign="top">I had written a comment earlier but realized it came out all wrong. Sorry if I offended. I said your images are getting better which sounds ludicrous because they have always been intriguing. This one resonated with me a lot more for some reason, possibly due to the fact that sometimes I''m lazy while voting, I look for instant gratification rather than dwelling on an image. This offers a bit of a bridge between (for lack of a better term) artsy fartsy and a more conventional image. Does that make sense? Anyways, love the mystery, the movement, the light and the color. And gosh I hope this is Niall''s work or none of this makes sense. If it''s not Niall''s I would be plain amazed.</td>', 'I had written a comment earlier but realized it came out all wrong. Sorry if I offended. I said your images are getting better which sounds ludicrous because they have always been intriguing. This one resonated with me a lot more for some reason, possibly due to the fact that sometimes I''m lazy while voting, I look for instant gratification rather than dwelling on an image. This offers a bit of a bridge between (for lack of a better term) artsy fartsy and a more conventional image. Does that make sense? Anyways, love the mystery, the movement, the light and the color. And gosh I hope this is Niall''s work or none of this makes sense. If it''s not Niall''s I would be plain amazed.', '2016-11-03 12:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
