(7481217, 1189959, 182284, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, composition, lighting, and colors. It''s simply impossible to be critical with a photo like this. I suppose these beautiful Autumn shots just capture my heart. 8</td>', 'Lovely photo, composition, lighting, and colors. It''s simply impossible to be critical with a photo like this. I suppose these beautiful Autumn shots just capture my heart. 8', '2016-11-06 19:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
