(7481353, 1189954, 180710, '<td valign="top">Model looks great!  But I wish the sky were darker and the trees weren''t underexposed; then that highlighting on the grass would really pop.</td>', 'Model looks great!  But I wish the sky were darker and the trees weren''t underexposed; then that highlighting on the grass would really pop.', '2016-11-07 09:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
