(7481356, 1189694, 180710, '<td valign="top">I wish this were cropped in more ... bringing the top right corner down to around the fork in the tree behind the subject.  Otherwise, I love the lighting, color and expression of the subject!</td>', 'I wish this were cropped in more ... bringing the top right corner down to around the fork in the tree behind the subject.  Otherwise, I love the lighting, color and expression of the subject!', '2016-11-07 09:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
