(7481358, 1189939, 180710, '<td valign="top">I like the concept ... Not sure what''s going on with the background though.  It appears the wall behind the model is blurry, then through the windshield is sharp, then elsewhere is in between, which keeps distracting me.</td>', 'I like the concept ... Not sure what''s going on with the background though.  It appears the wall behind the model is blurry, then through the windshield is sharp, then elsewhere is in between, which keeps distracting me.', '2016-11-07 09:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
